\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces System architecture. Arrows show the recording pipeline from ingestion through transcription, extraction, and deterministic consolidation to persistence and report presentation. Every persisted insight carries an evidence tuple that is validated against the stored transcript before it can reach a report.}}{5}{figure.1}\protected@file@percent }
