\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces Evidence-provenance chain. A candidate insight is persisted only if the validation gate resolves its recording and segment, checks identifier/index agreement, quote containment, and timing within $\pm 0.25$\,s. Consolidated insights retain source lineage and are re-validated against the source transcripts.}}{5}{figure.2}\protected@file@percent }
